{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08省略了“今天好不代表以后每天都好”这一关键转折，S12的“让对方安心”和S13的“心愿终于说出口”也存在一定的动机或事实改写，X在叙事准确性上更稳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的普通观众，Y的重点词加亮、话与感受纵向衔接，让人更容易迅速抓住每段在发生什么，同时感受音乐细节如何推动情绪变化；标注到时出现的内容也减少了同时阅读的负担。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更完整，尤其S08至S10的担忧、收束与重新放松，以及S13至S14的矛盾和接受，前后联系更清楚。但综合实际观看体验，Y的音乐感受更细腻具体，视觉层次也更容易扫读，因此整体略胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b86f7093-27d1-4078-b609-d20fab165cb2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T223417220527Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:34:59.077127+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff507f02403ec917bac70785b0536ce58de045e11a3e098575b282abdce80e87", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f